data: {"id": "bbafd724efa84852-thinking-layer-664", "run_id": "bbafd724efa84852", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 集群异常摘要\n\n**异常定位结果**\n*   **异常 Pod**: `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462`\n*   **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n*   **异常分类**: `Runtime` (Runtime 启动失败/应用进程异常退出)\n\n**诊断摘要**\n集群中目前仅有 1 个处于异常状态的 Pod，表现为反复崩溃重启（Restart 15 次）。根据诊断手册 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md`，需要进一步通过 `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl logs` 获取 Exit Code 和 Last State 信息以确定具体根因（如命令错误、端口冲突、磁盘满、探针杀进程等）。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789081584921}

